# Local Overrides

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` (which is gitignored) for machine-specific
notes and personal overrides that should never be shared via git — API endpoint
overrides, personal shortcuts, local paths, account URLs.

## Local Notes
- Primary development machine: [your machine]
- Claude plan: [your plan]
- Task system workspace: [your workspace URL]
- Any local tool accounts: [add as set up]
